== Description ==
Increases sources' profits based on character experience and pet level.

Gains [[Experience#Pet Experience|experience]] passively based on the number of upgrades bought, even when offline.

A true jack-of-all-trades, the Golem is suitable for almost any class. Before the [[Patch Notes#v0.2x "VoidStorm"|VoidStorm update]], it was mostly associated with the [[Arcanist]] and the [[Prodigy]].

== Pet Ability ==

Multiplies profits by:
<br><math>X^{0.32} \times L \times P \times 0.0065 + 1</math>

where:
* <math>L = \text{Pet Level}</math>
* <math>X = \text{Total Character Experience}</math>
* <math>P = \text{Pet Ability Power}</math>

== Experience Gain ==
Golem gains experience each second, equal to:
<br><math>\left(\frac{U^{0.45}}{2} + F\right) \times M</math>

where:
* <math>U = \text{Bought Upgrades}</math>
* <math>F = \text{Fixed Pet XP Bonus}</math>
* <math>M = \text{Pet XP Multiplier}</math>

